n">}</span><br/></div><div class="cm-line ">  <span class="sp-syntax-comment">//...</span><br/></div><div class="cm-line "><span class="sp-syntax-punctuation">}</span></div></code></pre></div></div></div></div><!--/$-->
<p class="whitespace-pre-wrap my-4">Burada, <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">[...history, nextSquares]</code> <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">history</code> ve ardından <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">nextSquares</code> içindeki tüm öğeleri içeren yeni bir dizi oluşturur. (<code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">...history</code> <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Spread_syntax" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" class="inline text-link dark:text-link-dark border-b border-link border-opacity-0 hover:border-opacity-100 duration-100 ease-in transition leading-normal"><em>spread sözdizimi</em></a> ifadesini “<code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">history</code> içindeki tüm öğeleri sırala” şeklinde okuyabilirsiniz.)</p>
<p class="whitespace-pre-wrap my-4">Örneğin, eğer <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">history</code> <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">[[null,null,null], [&quot;X&quot;,null,null]]</code> ve <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">nextSquares</code> <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">[&quot;X&quot;,null,&quot;O&quot;]</code> ise, yeni <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">[...history, nextSquares]</code> dizisi <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">[[null,null,null], [&quot;X&quot;,null,null], [&quot;X&quot;,null,&quot;O&quot;]]</code> olacaktır.</p>
<p class="whitespace-pre-wrap my-4">Bu noktada, state’i <code dir="ltr" class="inline text-code text-secondary dark:text-secondary-dark px-1 rounded-md no-underline bg-gray-30 bg-opacity-10 py-px">Game</code> bileşeni içine taşıdınız ve kullanıcı arayüzü, tıpkı düzenleme işleminden önce olduğu gibi tamamen çalışıyor olmalıdır. İşte bu noktada kodun nasıl görünmesi gerektiği:</p>
